          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most buyers, the best power inverter is the Renogy 2000W pure sine unit: enough power for a microwave or coffee maker, UL 458 certification, and the cables and remote in the box. RV owners who want dealer support should look at the Go Power GP-SW2000-12, boat and expedition builders at the Victron Phoenix 12/1200, and most van campers will be better served by the Renogy 1000W, which needs half the battery and half the wiring.
          </p>
